# KSV-0125: ghcr.io/resmoio (kubernetes-event-exporter), quay.io/thanos (Thanos),
# and docker.io/prom (memcached-exporter) are the canonical upstream registries
# for these projects. Treating them as untrusted requires a site-specific registry
# allowlist configuration, which is beyond the scope of these reference manifests.
KSV-0125

# DS137138: All flagged URLs are internal Kubernetes cluster service addresses
# (.svc.cluster.local). They are not publicly reachable. Intra-cluster TLS is
# an optional infrastructure layer (service mesh) that operators can add; the
# reference architecture uses standard HTTP for in-cluster service communication.
DS137138
